# Highest risk tier the factory may auto-merge once CI is green.
#   none  every pull request waits for you (use this for the first two weeks)
#   R0    docs, copy, work records
#   R1    ordinary changes inside existing boundaries
# R2 always needs the 'human-approved' label. R3 is never done by the factory.
AUTO_MERGE_MAX_TIER=none
